!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/link/invalid/a-value-entrys-segment-outside-the-family-it-enters-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/link-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.12, [TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2"
  description: """
    Each segment is judged by the family of what it enters. `main.internal` is an `api`, keyed by `meta.identifier`,
    which admits no space, so `good morning` is no name of it, selects nothing, and the reference is refused. The
    same segment selects a key of `phrases`, whose family is `word`.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
